<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
  <title>Azure visibility</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"/>
  <style>
    :root {
      --azure-blue: #0078d4;
      --azure-blue-dark: #005a9e;
      --surface: #f5f6f8;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --border: #e1e4e8;
      --text: #1b1b1b;
      --muted: #5c5c5c;
      --accent-bg: #e8f4fc;
      --radius: 10px;
      --shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Open Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--surface);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--azure-blue) 0%, var(--azure-blue-dark) 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 2.25rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .hero-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero h1 {
      margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .hero p { margin: 0.25rem 0 0; opacity: 0.92; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .wrap { max-width: 1200px; margin: -1.25rem auto 2.5rem; padding: 0 1.25rem; position: relative; }
    .summary-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    }
    .card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--azure-blue-dark);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .card h2 i { opacity: 0.85; font-size: 1rem; }
    .stat-value { font-size: 1.65rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.2; }
    .stat-label { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.15rem; }
    .section { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .section > .card { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }
    .section-header {
      padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
      background: var(--accent-bg);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .section-header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--azure-blue-dark); }
    .section-header p { margin: 0.35rem 0 0; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
    table.data {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }
    table.data th, table.data td {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    table.data th {
      background: #fafbfc;
      font-weight: 600;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    table.data tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #fcfcfd; }
    table.data tbody tr:hover { background: #f0f7fc; }
    .mono {
      font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", "Source Code Pro", monospace;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      word-break: break-all;
    }
    .type-pill {
      display: inline-block;
      max-width: 100%;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--azure-blue-dark);
      background: var(--accent-bg);
      padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid #c7e4f8;
    }
    .tags-muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }
    a { color: var(--azure-blue); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    details.card { padding: 0; }
    details.card summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    details.card summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    details.card[open] summary { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }
    footer a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <h1><i class="fa-brands fa-microsoft" aria-hidden="true"></i> Azure visibility</h1>
      <p>Resource group automation snapshot — Ansible-generated report</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="summary-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-folder-tree" aria-hidden="true"></i> Scope</h2>
        <div class="stat-value" style="font-size:1.1rem;">{{ azure_visibility_resource_group_name }}</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Resource group</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> Generated</h2>
        <div class="stat-value" style="font-size:1.1rem;">{{ ansible_date_time.date | default('') }}</div>
        <div class="stat-label">{{ ansible_date_time.time | default('') }} (controller time)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group" aria-hidden="true"></i> ARM resources</h2>
        <div class="stat-value">{{ azure_visibility_arm_resources | length }}</div>
        <div class="stat-label">In this resource group</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-database" aria-hidden="true"></i> Storage accounts</h2>
        <div class="stat-value">{{ azure_visibility_storage_accounts | length }}</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Detected via storage API</div>
      </div>
    </div>

{% if azure_visibility_subscription_hint | default('') | length > 0 %}
    <p class="tags-muted" style="margin: -0.5rem 0 1.25rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-fingerprint" aria-hidden="true"></i> Subscription hint: <span class="mono">{{ azure_visibility_subscription_hint }}</span></p>
{% endif %}

    <section class="section">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-list-ul" aria-hidden="true"></i> Resource inventory</h2>
          <p>All Azure Resource Manager resources in the group (read-only inventory). Types reflect Azure provider namespaces.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table class="data">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Name</th>
                <th>Type</th>
                <th>Location</th>
                <th>Tags</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
{% for r in (azure_visibility_arm_resources | sort(attribute='name')) %}
{% set tagmap = r.tags | default({}, true) %}
              <tr>
                <td><strong>{{ r.name | default('', true) }}</strong></td>
                <td><span class="type-pill mono" title="{{ r.type | default('', true) }}">{{ r.type | default('', true) }}</span></td>
                <td>{{ r.location | default('—', true) }}</td>
                <td class="tags-muted">
                  {%- if tagmap -%}
                    {%- for item in tagmap | dict2items -%}
                      {%- if not loop.first -%}, {% endif -%}{{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  {%- else -%}
                    —
                  {%- endif -%}
                </td>
              </tr>
{% else %}
              <tr><td colspan="4">No ARM resources returned (check RBAC or set <span class="mono">azure_visibility_collect_arm_resources: true</span>).</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-hard-drive" aria-hidden="true"></i> Storage accounts (detail)</h2>
          <p>From storage account API — SKU, kind, access tier, and blob endpoint.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table class="data">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Name</th>
                <th>Location</th>
                <th>SKU</th>
                <th>Kind</th>
                <th>Access tier</th>
                <th>Blob endpoint</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
{% for a in azure_visibility_storage_accounts %}
{% set sku = a.sku.name | default(a.account_type | default('', true), true) %}
{% set tier = a.access_tier | default(a.accessTier | default('', true), true) %}
{% set pe = a.primary_endpoints | default(a.primaryEndpoints | default({}, true), true) %}
{% set blob_raw = (pe.blob | default(pe['blob'], true)) if pe else none %}
{% if blob_raw is mapping %}
{% set blob_ep = blob_raw.endpoint | default(blob_raw['endpoint'] | default('', true), true) %}
{% else %}
{% set blob_ep = blob_raw | default('', true) %}
{% endif %}
              <tr>
                <td><strong>{{ a.name | default('', true) }}</strong></td>
                <td>{{ a.location | default('', true) }}</td>
                <td>{{ sku }}</td>
                <td>{{ a.kind | default('', true) }}</td>
                <td>{{ tier }}</td>
                <td class="mono">{% if blob_ep %}<a href="{{ blob_ep }}">{{ blob_ep }}</a>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
              </tr>
{% else %}
              <tr><td colspan="6">No storage accounts returned for this resource group.</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <details class="card section">
      <summary><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info" aria-hidden="true"></i> About this report</summary>
      <div style="padding: 1rem 1.15rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted);">
        <p style="margin:0 0 0.75rem;">This page is produced by Ansible (playbook <span class="mono">10_azure_storage_visibility_report.yml</span>) and served via Azure Container Apps / Front Door for demos. Inventory uses <span class="mono">azure_rm_resource_info</span>; storage rows use <span class="mono">azure_rm_storageaccount_info</span>.</p>
        <p style="margin:0;">You can extend the playbook with additional <span class="mono">*_info</span> modules (VMs, networking, AKS, etc.) and add sections to this template the same way as the hybrid-cloud AWS report pattern.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Built with Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform patterns · <a href="https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/collections/azure/azcollection/azure_rm_resource_info_module.html">Azure collection docs</a></p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
